msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Dialog Title"
msgid "KeeperFX Background Music"
msgstr "KeeperFX Achtergrondmuziek"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Header"
msgid "Download Music Files"
msgstr "Download Muziek bestanden"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Information"
msgid ""
"It seems the background music files were not found. This might happen when "
"you copied over the Dungeon Keeper files from the CD instead of a digital "
"release.\n"
"\n"
"You can let the launcher automatically download them because you have "
"already proven your ownership of the original Dungeon Keeper game files.\n"
"\n"
"If you do not download the music files you will need to have the original CD "
"in your disk drive to hear the background music."
msgstr ""
"Het lijkt erop dat de achtergrondmuziekbestanden niet gevonden zijn. Dit kan "
"gebeuren als je de Dungeon Keeper-bestanden van de cd hebt gekopieerd in "
"plaats van een digitale versie te gebruiken.\n"
"\n"
"Je kunt de launcher de bestanden automatisch laten downloaden, omdat je al "
"hebt aangetoond dat je eigenaar bent van de originele Dungeon Keeper-"
"bestanden.\n"
"\n"
"Als je de muziekbestanden niet downloadt, zul je de originele cd in je "
"schijfstation moeten hebben om de achtergrondmuziek te kunnen horen."

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Button"
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Annuleer"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Button"
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Download"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Failure Message"
msgid "Failed to get download URL for music archive"
msgstr "Ophalen van download-URL voor muziek archief is mislukt"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Failure Message"
msgid "Invalid music archive file extension. It must be a 7zip archive."
msgstr ""
"Ongeldige bestandsextensie voor muziekarchief. Het moet een 7zip-archief "
"zijn."

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Failure Message"
msgid "Failed to download music archive"
msgstr "Downloaden van muziekarchief is mislukt"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Failure message"
msgid "Music archive test failed. It may be corrupted."
msgstr "De test van het muziekarchief is mislukt. Het is mogelijk beschadigd."

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Progress bar"
msgid "Extracting: %p%"
msgstr "Uitpakken: %p%"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid "The KeeperFX background music has been successfully downloaded!"
msgstr "De achtergrondmuziek van KeeperFX is succesvol gedownload!"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|Progress bar"
msgid "Downloading: %p% (%vMiB)"
msgstr "Downloaden: %p% (%vMiB)"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|MessageBox Title"
msgid "Download failed"
msgstr "Downloaden mislukt"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|MessageBox Title"
msgid "Confirmation"
msgstr "Bevestiging"

msgctxt "DownloadMusicDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid ""
"Are you sure?\n"
"\n"
"You will not be able to hear the background music without having your CD in "
"your disk drive."
msgstr ""
"Weet je het zeker?\n"
"\n"
"Je zal de achtergrondmuziek niet kunnen horen zonder de cd in je "
"schijfstation."

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|Window Title"
msgid "Test internet lobby"
msgstr "Internet lobby testen"

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|Header"
msgid "Multiplayer Lobby Portforwarding Test"
msgstr "Meerspeler Lobby Portforwarding Test"

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|Information Label"
msgid ""
"This tool checks if your KeeperFX multiplayer lobby can be reached from the "
"internet. You don't need to use this for local games, as those are already "
"accessible within your network."
msgstr ""
"Deze tool controleert of je KeeperFX multiplayerlobby bereikbaar is vanaf "
"het internet. Je hoeft dit niet te gebruiken voor lokale spellen, omdat die "
"al toegankelijk zijn binnen je netwerk."

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|Information Label"
msgid ""
"To host a game online, you must open port 5556 in your router. How to do "
"this is different for every router and internet provider, so check online "
"for instructions or ask your provider for help."
msgstr ""
"Om een spel online te hosten, moet je poort 5556 in je router openen. Hoe je "
"dit moet doen verschilt per router en internetprovider, dus kijk online voor "
"instructies of vraag je provider om hulp."

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|Information Label"
msgid ""
"KeeperFX only works with IPv4. If you don't have an IPv4 address or you are "
"using a shared one (CGNAT), you won't be able to host an online game. You "
"can ask your internet provider if they can give you an IPv4 address."
msgstr ""
"KeeperFX werkt alleen met IPv4. Als je geen IPv4 adres hebt of een gedeeld "
"adres (CGNAT), kun je geen online spel hosten. Je kunt je internetprovider "
"vragen of ze je een IPv4-adres kunnen geven."

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|Button"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Sluiten"

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|Button"
msgid "Test"
msgstr "Test"

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|MessageBox Title"
msgid "IPv6 Detected"
msgstr "IPv6 Gedetecteerd"

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid "Failed to retrieve public IP address."
msgstr "Opvragen van publiek IP-adres is mislukt."

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid "This tool only works with IPv4."
msgstr "Deze tool werkt alleen met IPv4."

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|MessageBox Title"
msgid "Portforwarding tool"
msgstr "Portforwarding-tool"

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid "Failed to start ENET server."
msgstr "ENET-server kon niet worden gestart."

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid "Failed to contact KeeperFX.net"
msgstr "Contacteren van KeeperFX.net is mislukt"

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid "Your router is correctly port forwarded!"
msgstr "Port forwarding is correct ingesteld op je router!"

msgctxt "EnetServerTestDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid "Failed to connect to local ENET server."
msgstr "Verbinding met lokale ENET-server mislukt."

msgctxt "FileRemoverDialog|Window Title"
msgid "Remove leftover files"
msgstr "Verwijder achtergebleven bestanden"

msgctxt "FileRemoverDialog|Header"
msgid "Remove leftover files"
msgstr "Verwijder achtergebleven bestanden"

msgctxt "FileRemoverDialog|Information Label"
msgid ""
"The KeeperFX launcher has found files that were left over after KeeperFX was "
"updated. These files might cause issues and should be removed."
msgstr ""
"De KeeperFX launcher heeft bestanden gevonden die zijn achtergebleven na een "
"update van KeeperFX. Deze bestanden kunnen problemen veroorzaken en kunnen "
"best verwijderd worden."

msgctxt "FileRemoverDialog|Checkbox Toggle"
msgid "Always remove leftover files automatically"
msgstr "Verwijder overgebleven bestanden altijd automatisch"

msgctxt "FileRemoverDialog|Button"
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Annuleer"

msgctxt "FileRemoverDialog|Button"
msgid "Remove All"
msgstr "Alles verwijderen"

msgctxt "FileRemoverDialog|MessageBox Title"
msgid "Confirmation"
msgstr "Bevestiging"

msgctxt "FileRemoverDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid ""
"KeeperFX might not function correctly if these files are present.\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure you want to keep them?"
msgstr ""
"KeeperFX werkt mogelijk niet goed als deze bestanden aanwezig zijn.\n"
"\n"
"Weet je zeker dat je ze wilt behouden?"

msgctxt "FileRemoverDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid "Something went wrong while removing leftover files."
msgstr "Er is iets misgegaan bij het verwijderen van achtergebleven bestanden."

msgctxt "FileRemoverDialog|MessageBox Text"
msgid "Leftover files have been removed!"
msgstr "Achtergebleven bestanden zijn verwijderd!"

msgctxt "Game|MessageBox Title"
msgid "KeeperFX could not start"
msgstr ""

#, qt-format
msgctxt "Game|MessageBox Text"
msgid ""
"KeeperFX could not be started.\n"
"\n"
"This is not a game crash — the program stopped before it began running. That "
"normally means this installation no longer matches the libraries on your "
"system, which an update can cause. Reinstalling or rebuilding KeeperFX "
"usually fixes it.\n"
"\n"
"Details:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""

#, qt-format
msgctxt "Game|"
msgid "The program exited immediately with code %1."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "Game|MessageBox Title"
msgid "KeeperFX has crashed"
msgstr "KeeperFX is gecrasht"

msgctxt "Game|MessageBox Text"
msgid ""
"It seems that KeeperFX has crashed and is unable to recover.\n"
"\n"
"Crash reporting is disabled because you are using the heavylog option.\n"
"\n"
"To report it, open an issue on our GitHub page and attach keeperfx.log from "
"your game folder:\n"
"https://github.com/ForkedInTime/keeperfx-tux-edition/issues"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "InstallKfxDialog|Window Title"
